cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research software, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "JEVPFN: Decision-model text features for tabular prediction"
authors:
  - family-names: Goethals
    given-names: Andreas
    affiliation: KU Leuven
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: https://github.com/andreasgoethals/JEVPFN
url: https://github.com/andreasgoethals/JEVPFN
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Research software comparing frozen task-conditioned decision-model features,
  frozen text embeddings with training-fold PCA, and native-text predictors on
  18 selected MulTaBench text datasets. Decision-feature construction excludes
  row labels and non-text row values. Cached per-column and joint representations
  support paired comparisons within fixed predictors and cross-validation splits.
  Exploration retains all 20 core datasets.
keywords:
  - tabular prediction
  - decision models
  - text features
  - text embeddings
  - reproducible evaluation
  - MulTaBench
